// info
Upon arriving in Zaekolaerr, the player learns of the Coliseum of Ages, a legendary arena where conflicts are resolved through combat.
To negotiate peace with the orcs and satyr, the player decides to prove their worth in the Coliseum. They must navigate through a series of challenging battles, facing off against formidable opponents, earning the respect and admiration of both the orcs and satyr.
If the player emerges victorious and brings joy to the satyr by showcasing their combat prowess, a peace treaty is guaranteed. The orcs, impressed by the player's strength and skill, agree to the terms of peace.

